00:57:51.910 --> 00:57:59.030
<v Ira Glass>Thanks, as always, to our program's co-founder, Mr. Torey Malatia. He was doing yoga for a while to relax, but it was not working.

00:57:59.030 --> 00:58:03.220
<v D'vondre Woodard>I'm not doing that no more. What I'm doing is marijuana.

00:58:03.220 --> 00:58:08.220
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life .
